​Auto Update Injector is a professional solution designed to integrate seamless automated updates into your extensions and tools. This tool generates ready-to-use code that enables your projects to check for and apply updates efficiently. It includes advanced features such as a dedicated dialog box to display new update logs, ensuring your users are always informed about the latest improvements. Additionally, it offers customizable notification settings, including sound and vibration alerts, which trigger automatically when an update is available. This tool simplifies the update process, allowing you to maintain your projects with minimal effort while providing a smooth user experience.